\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Earth below is teeming,
\par Heaven is bright above;
\par Every brow is beaming
\par In the light of love;
\par Every eye rejoices,
\par Every thought is praise;
\par Happy hearts and voices
\par Gladen nights and days.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Every youth and maiden,
\par On the harvest plain,
\par Round the waggons laden
\par With their golden grain,
\par Swell the happy chorus
\par On the evening air,
\par Unto Him who o'er us
\par Bends with constant care.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. For the sun and showers,
\par For the rain and dew,
\par For the happy hours
\par Spring and summer knew;
\par For the golden autumn
\par And its precious stores,
\par For the love that brought them
\par Teeming to our doors.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Earth's broad harvest whitens
\par In a brighter sun
\par Than the orb that lightens
\par All we tread upon.
\par Send our labourers, Father,
\par Where fields ripening wave;
\par And the nations gather,
\par Gather in and save.
\par                     Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

